完成顺序不等于覆盖范围，应保存每个任务状态、报告和退出码。任一必需分片失败或未执行都使门禁不通过；取消其余分片时区分失败与被取消，不能把缺报告计成成功。

参考实现：
```python
import pathlib,subprocess,time

def run_shards(shards, report_dir, timeout):
    report_dir=pathlib.Path(report_dir);report_dir.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
    jobs=[]
    for shard in shards:
        started=time.monotonic()
        proc=subprocess.Popen(shard['argv'],stdout=subprocess.PIPE,stderr=subprocess.PIPE,shell=False)
        jobs.append((shard['id'],proc,started+timeout))
    results=[]
    try:
        for name,proc,deadline in jobs:
            try:
                out,err=proc.communicate(timeout=max(.001,deadline-time.monotonic()))
                status='passed' if proc.returncode==0 else 'failed'
            except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:
                proc.kill();out,err=proc.communicate();status='timeout'
            (report_dir/(name+'.stdout')).write_bytes(out)
            (report_dir/(name+'.stderr')).write_bytes(err)
            results.append({'id':name,'status':status,'exit_code':proc.returncode})
    finally:
        for _,proc,_ in jobs:
            if proc.poll() is None:proc.kill()
            proc.wait()
    return {'passed':all(x['status']=='passed' for x in results),'results':results}
```
先Popen所有任务，再按各自启动截止时间communicate。收集失败与超时输出并wait回收，最终门禁使用所有状态的all，而非最后完成者。

