PR头提交测试只覆盖它与某个基线的关系，合并队列可能将多个变更按顺序组合到最新目标分支，生成新的候选提交；此前分别绿色的变更仍可能在组合后冲突。门禁需绑定队列生成的候选SHA和实际检查事件，队列重排或基线推进后重新评估，不能仅按PR编号查最近一次成功。平台使用merge_group等事件时要确认必需检查确实被触发且回报到正确提交，避免永久等待或错误沿用旧结果。验证两个单独通过但组合失败的变更、队列重建和一个候选被移除后的重测，核对最终合并对象与证据一致。取消候选只撤销合并资格，不应删除其他已批准发布记录，职责应与部署流水线分开。

```python
import re,subprocess
def eligible(repo, branch_ref, base, pr, candidate, required, checks):
    def oid(value):return isinstance(value,str) and re.fullmatch('[0-9a-f]{40}',value) is not None
    def git(*args):
        result=subprocess.run(['git','-C',str(repo),*args],capture_output=True,text=True,timeout=5)
        if result.returncode:raise ValueError('git query failed')
        return result.stdout.strip()
    if not isinstance(branch_ref,str) or not branch_ref.startswith('refs/heads/') or not all(oid(x) for x in (base,pr,candidate)):return False
    if not isinstance(required,list) or not required or any(not isinstance(x,str) or not x for x in required) or len(set(required))!=len(required):return False
    if not isinstance(checks,list):return False
    try:
        git('check-ref-format',branch_ref)
        if git('show-ref','--verify','--hash',branch_ref)!=base:return False
        if any(git('cat-file','-t',x)!='commit' for x in (base,pr,candidate)):return False
        if git('rev-list','--parents','-n','1',candidate).split()!=[candidate,base,pr]:return False
    except ValueError:return False
    relevant={name:[] for name in required}
    for check in checks:
        if not isinstance(check,dict) or set(check)!={'sha','name','run_id','status','conclusion'}:return False
        if not oid(check['sha']) or not isinstance(check['name'],str) or not check['name'] or type(check['run_id']) is not int or check['run_id']<1 or check['status'] not in ('queued','in_progress','completed') or check['conclusion'] not in (None,'success','failure','cancelled','skipped'):return False
        if check['sha']==candidate and check['name'] in relevant:relevant[check['name']].append(check)
    for values in relevant.values():
        if not values:return False
        latest=max(value['run_id'] for value in values);chosen=[value for value in values if value['run_id']==latest]
        if len(chosen)!=1 or chosen[0]['status']!='completed' or chosen[0]['conclusion']!='success':return False
    return True
```
先核验实际候选父链及目标引用，再仅接受该候选最新完成的必需检查；业务组合回归不能靠两个独立绿色分支证明安全。

