answer:
一个对象通常只能有一个控制器所有者，表示主要管理关系。多个系统共同写资源需明确字段或对象边界，不能各自争当controller；普通附属关系也要满足API约束。

```json
{
  "apiVersion": "v1",
  "kind": "ConfigMap",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "managed-settings",
    "namespace": "training",
    "labels": {
      "purpose": "owner-handoff"
    },
    "ownerReferences": [
      {
        "apiVersion": "v1",
        "kind": "ConfigMap",
        "name": "legacy-owner",
        "uid": "${LEGACY_UID}",
        "controller": false,
        "blockOwnerDeletion": false
      },
      {
        "apiVersion": "v1",
        "kind": "ConfigMap",
        "name": "next-owner",
        "uid": "${NEXT_UID}",
        "controller": true,
        "blockOwnerDeletion": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "data": {
    "mode": "keep"
  }
}
```
多个普通owner并不等于多个controller。把旧controller改为普通owner并同时指定新controller，可在同一次有效API更新中交接；非法双controller对象并未持久化。

